Z||000001||fieronv||10-17-2001||11:16 AM||||Make sure that you have your key switch turn to the aux position or on and check again. Then check your fuse. If this doesn't fix it your going to have to get a multi-meter out and back track your wiring to find the break in the wires.||||reg||1
